1. Introduction
The Smart Contact Management System is a menu-driven console application designed to store and manage contact information. It allows users to create, display, search, update, delete, and sort contacts while preserving data between program runs.
2. Problem Statement
Manual contact management can make records difficult to search, update, and maintain. This project provides a structured solution with unique IDs, phone-number duplicate checks, validation, linked-list storage, and persistent file handling.
