10. File Handling and Data Integrity
The file is data/contacts.txt.
Each record contains six fields separated by |.
Backslash escapes pipe, backslash, newline, and carriage return.
Startup loads records; malformed rows and duplicate ID/phone rows are skipped.
The save routine reports file-open and write failures. Saving on the explicit Save menu and on Exit preserves the data in normal operation.
