14. Challenges and Solutions
Managing pointer ownership is addressed with a clear linked-list destructor and delete operations.
Duplicate phone comparison normalizes to digits.
Sorting uses a temporary node-pointer vector to avoid changing linked-list topology.
File records use escaping so delimiters in text fields do not corrupt the format.
